  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1903.10 Initial Certifications: Issuance and Duration.\n\n(a) Initial certifications shall be issued in accordance with Plc 304.11.\n\n(b) Initial certifications shall be valid as provided in Plc 304.12.\n\nSource. #14429, eff 1-16-26, EXPIRES 1-16-36",
